{
  "mark.3.p1.b1": {
    "text": "อีก​ครั้ง​หนึ่ง​พระองค์​เข้า​ไป​ใน​ธรรม​ศาลา",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p1.b2": {
    "text": "มี​ชาย​มือ​ลีบ​คน​หนึ่ง​อยู่​ที่​นั่น",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:1"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p1.b3": {
    "text": "พวก​เขา​จึง​คอย​จับ​ตา​ดู​พระองค์​อย่าง​ใกล้ชิด​ว่า​จะ​รักษา​โรค​ให้​ชาย​คน​นี้​ใน​วัน​สะบาโต​หรือ​ไม่",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p1.b4": {
    "text": "บาง​คน​หา​เหตุ​ที่​จะ​กล่าว​หา​พระเยซู",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:2"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p2.b1": {
    "text": "พระเยซู​พูด​กับ​ชาย​มือ​ลีบ​ว่า",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p2.b2": {
    "text": "มา​ยืน​ข้าง​หน้า​นี่​สิ",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:3"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p2.b3": {
    "text": "แล้ว​พระเยซู​ถาม​พวก​เขา​ว่า",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p2.b4": {
    "text": "อย่าง​ไหน​ถูกต้อง​ตาม​กฎ​บัญญัติ​ใน​วัน​สะบาโต ทำ​ดี​หรือ​ทำ​ชั่ว",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p2.b5": {
    "text": "ช่วย​ชีวิต​หรือ​ฆ่า​ทำลาย​ชีวิต",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p2.b6": {
    "text": "แต่​พวก​เขา​ยัง​คง​นิ่ง​เงียบ",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:4"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p3.b1": {
    "text": "พระองค์​กวาด​ตา​มอง​พวก​เขา​ด้วย​ความ​โกรธ",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p3.b2": {
    "text": "และ​เสียใจ​ที่​พวก​เขา​มี​ใจ​แข็ง​กระด้าง",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p3.b3": {
    "text": "จึง​พูด​กับ​ชาย​คน​นั้น​ว่า",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p3.b4": {
    "text": "จง​เหยียด​มือ​ของ​เจ้า​ออก​มา",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p3.b5": {
    "text": "เขา​เหยียด​มือ​ออก",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p3.b6": {
    "text": "แล้ว​มือ​ของ​เขา​ก็​หาย​เป็น​ปกติ",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:5"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p4.b1": {
    "text": "พวก​ฟาริสี​จึง​ออก​ไป",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p4.b2": {
    "text": "แล้ว​เริ่ม​วาง​แผน​กับ​พวก​ของ​เฮโรด​ว่า",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p4.b3": {
    "text": "จะ​ฆ่า​พระเยซู​ได้​อย่างไร",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:6"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p5.b1": {
    "text": "พระเยซู​กับ​พวก​สาวก​ปลีก​ตัว​ไป​ยัง​ทะเลสาบ และ​ฝูง​ชน​กลุ่ม​ใหญ่​จาก​กาลิลี​ตาม​ไป​ด้วย",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:7"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p5.b2": {
    "text": "เมื่อ​ได้ยิน​กิตติศัพท์​ของ​พระองค์ ผู้​คน​มากมาย​จาก​ยูเดีย เยรูซาเล็ม อิดูเมอา",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p5.b3": {
    "text": "และ​อีก​ฟาก​หนึ่ง​ของ​แม่น้ำ​จอร์แดน รอบ​เมือง​ไทระ​และ​เมือง​ไซดอน",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p5.b4": {
    "text": "ต่าง​พา​กัน​มา​หา​พระองค์",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:8"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p6.b1": {
    "text": "เนื่อง​จาก​มี​ฝูงชน​มากมาย พระเยซู​จึง​สั่ง​สาวก​ให้​เตรียม​เรือ​เล็ก​ไว้​พร้อม​สำหรับ​พระองค์",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:9"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p6.b2": {
    "text": "เนื่อง​จาก​พระเยซู​ได้​รักษา​คน​มากมาย คน​ป่วย​ด้วย​โรค​ต่าง​ๆ จึง​เบียด​กัน​เข้า​มา​เพื่อ​แตะ​ตัว​พระองค์",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:10"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p7.b1": {
    "text": "ทุก​ครั้ง​ที่​วิญญาณ​โสโครก​เห็น​พระองค์ พวก​มัน​จะ​หมอบ​กราบ",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p7.b2": {
    "text": "และ​ร้อง​ว่า",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p7.b3": {
    "text": "พระองค์​เป็น​พระบุตร​ของ​พระเจ้า",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:11"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p7.b4": {
    "text": "แต่​พระองค์​ห้าม​พวก​มัน​เด็ด​ขาด ไม่​ให้​บอก​คน​อื่น​ว่า​พระองค์​เป็น​ใคร",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:12"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p8.b1": {
    "text": "พระเยซู​ขึ้น​ไป​ที่​บน​ภูเขา",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p8.b2": {
    "text": "และ​เรียก​คน​ที่​ต้องการ​ให้​มา​พบ",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p8.b3": {
    "text": "และ​พวก​เขา​ก็​มา​หา​พระองค์",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:13"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p9.b1": {
    "text": "พระองค์​แต่งตั้ง​สิบ​สอง​คน",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p9.b2": {
    "text": "ให้​อยู่​กับ​พระองค์",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p9.b3": {
    "text": "และ​จะ​ส่ง​พวก​เขา​ออก​ไป​ประกาศ",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:14"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p9.b4": {
    "text": "และ​ให้​พวก​เขา​มี​อำนาจ​ใน​การ​ขับ​ผี",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:15"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p10.b1": {
    "text": "สาวก​ทั้ง​สิบ​สอง​คน​นี้​ได้แก่ ซีโมน (พระองค์​ตั้ง​ชื่อ​ว่า เปโตร)",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:16"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p10.b2": {
    "text": "ยากอบ​ลูก​ชาย​เศเบดี​กับ​ยอห์น​ผู้​เป็น​น้อง​ชาย",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p10.b3": {
    "text": "(พระองค์​ตั้ง​ชื่อ​ให้​ว่า โบอาเนอเย หมายถึง ลูก​ฟ้า​ร้อง)",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:17"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p11.b1": {
    "text": "อันดรูว์",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p11.b2": {
    "text": "ฟีลิป บารโธโลมิว",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p11.b3": {
    "text": "มัทธิว",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p11.b4": {
    "text": "โธมัส ยากอบ​ลูก​ชาย​อัลเฟอัส",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p11.b5": {
    "text": "ธัดเดอัส ซีโมน​พรรค​ชาติ​นิยม",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:18"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p11.b6": {
    "text": "และ​ยูดาส​อิสคาริโอท​ผู้​ทรยศ​พระองค์",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:19"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p12.b1": {
    "text": "จาก​นั้น​พระเยซู​เข้า​ไป​ใน​บ้าน ฝูง​ชน​ก็​มา​ชุมนุม​กัน​อีก",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p12.b2": {
    "text": "จน​พระองค์​กับ​สาวก​ไม่​มี​เวลา​แม้​แต่​จะ​กิน​อาหาร",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:20"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p12.b3": {
    "text": "เมื่อ​ครอบครัว​ของ​พระองค์​ได้ยิน​เรื่อง​นี้​ก็​ออก​มา​รั้ง​พระองค์​ไว้",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p12.b4": {
    "text": "และ​พูด​ว่า “เขา​เสีย​สติ​ไป​แล้ว”",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:21"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p13.b1": {
    "text": "พวก​ครู​สอน​กฎ​บัญญัติ​ที่​มา​จาก​เยรูซาเล็ม​พูด​ว่า",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p13.b2": {
    "text": "เขา​ถูก​สิง​โดย​เบเอลเซบูล",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p13.b3": {
    "text": "และ…พูด​ว่า",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p13.b4": {
    "text": "ที่​เขา​ขับ​ผี​ออก​ได้​ก็​เพราะ​เจ้า​แห่ง​ผี",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:22"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p14.b1": {
    "text": "พระเยซู​เรียก​พวก​เขา​มา​แล้ว​พูด​เปรียบ​เทียบ​ว่า",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:23"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p14.b2": {
    "text": "ซาตาน​จะ​ไล่​ซาตาน​ออก​ได้​อย่างไร",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:23"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p14.b3": {
    "text": "ถ้า​อาณาจักร​ไหน​ที่​แตกแยก​กัน​เอง อาณาจักร​นั้น​ก็​ตั้ง​อยู่​ไม่​ได้",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:24"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p14.b4": {
    "text": "ถ้า​ครอบครัว​ไหน​แตกแยก​กัน​เอง ครอบครัว​นั้น​ก็​ตั้ง​อยู่​ไม่​ได้",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:25"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p15.b1": {
    "text": "และ​ถ้า​ซาตาน​ต่อต้าน​และ​แตกแยก​กับ​ตัว​มัน​เอง มัน​ก็​ตั้ง​อยู่​ไม่​ได้",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p15.b2": {
    "text": "และ​จะ​ถึง​จุด​จบ",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:26"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p15.b3": {
    "text": "จริง​ๆ แล้ว ไม่​มี​ใคร​เข้า​ไป​ใน​บ้าน​ของ​คน​ที่​แข็งแรง​ได้",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p15.b4": {
    "text": "นอก​จาก​จะ​จับ​เขา​มัด​ไว้​ก่อน",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p15.b5": {
    "text": "แล้ว​จึง​ปล้น​บ้าน​คน​ที่​แข็งแรง​นั้น​ได้",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:27"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p16.b1": {
    "text": "เรา​บอก​ความ​จริง​ท่าน​ว่า มนุษย์​จะ​ได้​รับ​การ​ยก​โทษ​จาก​บาป​และ​คำ​หมิ่น​ประมาท​ทั้ง​หมด​ของ​ตน",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:28"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p16.b2": {
    "text": "แต่​ใคร​พูด​หมิ่น​พระวิญญาณ​บริสุทธิ์ จะ​ไม่​มี​วัน​ได้​รับ​การ​ยก​โทษ",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:29"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p16.b3": {
    "text": "และ​มี​ความ​ผิด​บาป​ติด​ตัว​ตลอด​กาล",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:29"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p16.b4": {
    "text": "พระองค์​พูด​เช่น​นี้​เพราะ​พวก​เขา​พูด​ว่า",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:30"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p16.b5": {
    "text": "พระองค์​มี​วิญญาณ​โสโครก",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:30"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p17.b1": {
    "text": "แม่​กับ​พวก​น้อง​ชาย​ของ​พระเยซู​มา​ถึง พวก​เขา​ยืน​อยู่​ด้าน​นอก",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p17.b2": {
    "text": "และ​บอก​คน​ให้​เข้า​ไป​เรียก​พระองค์",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:31"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p17.b3": {
    "text": "ฝูงชน​นั่ง​อยู่​รอบ​พระเยซู",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:32"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p17.b4": {
    "text": "และ​พวก​เขา​บอก​พระองค์​ว่า",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:32"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p17.b5": {
    "text": "แม่​กับ​พวก​น้อง​ชาย​ของ​ท่าน​อยู่​ด้าน​นอก​มอง​หา​ท่าน",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:32"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p18.b1": {
    "text": "พระองค์​ถาม​ว่า",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:33"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p18.b2": {
    "text": "ใคร​คือ​แม่…",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:33"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p18.b3": {
    "text": "…และ​พี่​น้อง​ของ​เรา",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:33"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p18.b4": {
    "text": "แล้ว​พระองค์​ก็​มอง​ดู​คน​ที่​นั่ง​อยู่​รอบ​ตัว และ​พูด​ว่า",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p18.b5": {
    "text": "นี่​คือ​แม่​และ​พี่​น้อง​ของ​เรา",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:34"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p18.b6": {
    "text": "ใคร​ก็​ตาม​ที่​ทำ​ตาม​ความ​ประสงค์​ของ​พระเจ้า",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:35"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  },
  "mark.3.p18.b7": {
    "text": "คน​นั้น​คือ​พี่​น้อง​ชาย​หญิง​และ​แม่​ของ​เรา",
    "kind": "scripture",
    "source": {
      "version": "thatcv",
      "ref": "Mark 3:35"
    },
    "adapted": false,
    "status": "approved"
  }
}
